WEBVTT

00:12.810 --> 00:13.610
It's so cold!

00:16.600 --> 00:18.490
I should buy coffee.

00:26.800 --> 00:28.350
M-Mie-san.

00:29.290 --> 00:30.380
Komura-kun.

00:31.120 --> 00:32.800
It's cold today, huh?

00:32.800 --> 00:34.040
Yeah.

00:34.040 --> 00:38.260
I was thinking I'll have some 
warm cocoa or something.

00:39.160 --> 00:42.270
<i>It's like she's given up 
remembering her glasses.</i>

00:43.790 --> 00:46.010
M-Mie-san, will you be all right?

00:46.010 --> 00:48.000
Can you buy cocoa by yourself?

00:48.000 --> 00:49.190
I'll be all right.

00:49.490 --> 00:53.190
I can at least tell if it's hot or cold.

00:54.010 --> 00:54.970
Right.

00:54.970 --> 00:56.710
They're marked red and blue.

00:57.680 --> 00:59.810
"Can you buy it by yourself?"

00:59.810 --> 01:02.000
You sound like my mom.

01:02.000 --> 01:03.580
Err, sorry.

01:08.710 --> 01:10.590
M-Mie-san!

01:10.590 --> 01:11.540
Huh?

01:11.540 --> 01:12.650
What is this?

01:12.650 --> 01:13.580
It's bitter.

01:15.380 --> 01:17.800
Black coffee...

01:18.400 --> 01:22.130
The world's filled with all kinds of traps.

01:22.130 --> 01:24.060
That's a pretty general observation.

01:24.320 --> 01:25.920
What should I do with this?

01:27.420 --> 01:29.940
Komura-kun, can you drink black coffee?

01:42.240 --> 01:44.560
Oh, do you not like black either?

01:45.360 --> 01:47.400
Sorry, I'll drink it myself.

01:47.400 --> 01:48.270
I'll drink it!

01:48.270 --> 01:49.710
I will! Please!

01:50.020 --> 01:51.130
You like it?

01:51.130 --> 01:52.250
Good.

01:52.250 --> 01:53.210
Here you go.

02:02.020 --> 02:02.720
<i>In...</i>

02:04.720 --> 02:06.850
<i>Indirect...</i>

02:11.740 --> 02:16.440
Um, to be honest, I don't 
like black coffee, either.

02:16.440 --> 02:17.990
Oh, so you don't.

02:19.250 --> 02:21.930
<i>I couldn't bring myself to do it.</i>

02:22.830 --> 02:27.010
<i>I don't think my mental copy of her 
dad would have approved, either.</i>

02:35.760 --> 02:36.840
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

02:36.840 --> 02:39.850
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

04:01.760 --> 04:06.140
Episode 4

04:01.760 --> 04:06.140
I Chose a Pair of

04:01.760 --> 04:06.140
Glasses for the Girl I Like

04:07.580 --> 04:08.470
<i>Hello!</i>

04:08.470 --> 04:10.000
<i>Komura Kaede here!</i>

04:10.000 --> 04:12.020
<i>I'm running late!</i>

04:12.560 --> 04:15.440
<i>I might make it, just barely!</i>

04:18.560 --> 04:20.690
<i>M-Mie-san?!</i>

04:23.530 --> 04:27.370
<i>I'm glad I get to go to school with her, 
even under these circumstances.</i>

04:30.280 --> 04:32.120
<i>M-Morning.</i>

04:32.750 --> 04:35.210
<i>Morning, sir!</i>

04:38.310 --> 04:39.870
<i>Did she not notice it's me?</i>

04:39.870 --> 04:42.760
<i>She doesn't have her glasses, 
and she's in a hurry.</i>

04:50.550 --> 04:53.280
<i>Hurry up and change signals!</i>

04:55.950 --> 04:58.060
<i>Her hair's a mess.</i>

04:58.560 --> 04:59.810
<i>And she's covered in sweat.</i>

05:09.680 --> 05:12.450
E-Err... Your skirt...

05:14.280 --> 05:16.460
Oh, sorry about that.

05:18.780 --> 05:20.590
My hair's a mess, too.

05:20.920 --> 05:24.590
<i>She still thinks I'm a stranger.</i>

05:25.200 --> 05:28.840
I don't want to say hi to 
Komura-kun looking like this.

05:30.180 --> 05:33.350
I wonder if I'll have time to fix my hair...

05:40.760 --> 05:42.520
<i>She's...</i>

05:44.060 --> 05:46.860
<i>She's worried about how I'll see her?!</i>

05:48.580 --> 05:53.370
I sat there 
writhing 
for a while
and ended 
up being
late.

05:48.770 --> 05:52.320
I sat there writhing for 
a while and ended up being late.

06:07.260 --> 06:09.340
Sorry, Komura-kun.

06:09.340 --> 06:10.390
Nah...

06:10.960 --> 06:15.410
Not only did I fall and sprain my 
ankle, I broke my glasses, too.

06:18.520 --> 06:21.690
Boing, boing, boing...

06:18.960 --> 06:21.690
<i>And doing warm-up exercises, at that.</i>

06:20.190 --> 06:21.690
She
 falls 
two 
seconds 
later

06:22.010 --> 06:23.640
Mie-san, are you all right?

06:23.640 --> 06:26.400
Komura-kun, you should take 
her to the nurse's office.

06:27.300 --> 06:29.520
<i>What's up with Azuma-kun?</i>

06:29.520 --> 06:32.370
<i>Is he rooting for me?</i>

06:33.390 --> 06:35.870
<i>Her face is so close, along 
with everything else.</i>

06:36.580 --> 06:38.410
<i>Mie-san is so close!</i>

06:38.410 --> 06:42.880
<i>I guess Mie-san doesn't have 
any reason to get nervous.</i>

06:45.480 --> 06:46.640
Err...

06:46.640 --> 06:48.340
Sorry if I'm heavy.

06:49.840 --> 06:53.350
I've gained a bit lately.

06:54.190 --> 06:56.850
<i>She's worried about her weight?!</i>

06:58.510 --> 06:59.360
<i>So cute!</i>

06:59.850 --> 07:01.780
<i>So cute!</i>

07:02.860 --> 07:09.680
<i>I don't care how many kilograms, how 
many hundreds of kilograms she weighs.</i>

07:08.370 --> 07:12.360
His love 
weighs a 
metric
 ton.

07:09.680 --> 07:12.360
<i>His love weighs a metric ton.</i>

07:12.360 --> 07:14.870
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

07:15.440 --> 07:18.120
Huh? Where's the chairs?

07:19.090 --> 07:20.210
There's stuff on them.

07:20.470 --> 07:23.720
Sorry, could you lean on 
something for a second?

07:23.720 --> 07:24.780
Okay.

07:24.780 --> 07:26.460
I'll get a chair.

07:35.050 --> 07:36.930
Aah!

07:35.060 --> 07:36.940
Scale

07:37.200 --> 07:41.130
M-Mie-san, you shouldn't stand there!

07:41.130 --> 07:43.350
Huh? Wait, you aren't actually that heavy.

07:52.360 --> 07:55.130
Komura-kun, forget you saw that.

07:55.130 --> 07:57.280
No, but really. You're fine.

07:57.520 --> 07:59.040
Forget what you saw!

07:59.040 --> 08:03.550
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

08:00.270 --> 08:01.140
Okay.

08:01.140 --> 08:02.670
Forget what you saw.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.060
Almost there...

08:12.840 --> 08:14.770
What's up, Mie-san?

08:15.320 --> 08:16.260
Komura-kun.

08:16.880 --> 08:22.020
Sensei asked me to change 
the document on the board.

08:22.020 --> 08:23.420
<i>Damn it, Sensei!</i>

08:23.420 --> 08:26.410
<i>How could you ask Mie-san to do something 
when she's forgotten her glasses?!</i>

08:26.410 --> 08:28.910
I'm just a bit too short to reach.

08:30.540 --> 08:31.860
Sure, Mie-san.

08:31.860 --> 08:33.150
I'll...

08:42.700 --> 08:44.310
Hand me the document.

08:45.760 --> 08:48.510
Thanks, um...

08:48.990 --> 08:50.550
It's Azuma.

08:50.550 --> 08:52.880
Oh, it's Azuma-kun.

08:53.550 --> 08:55.550
<b>This Week's Menu</b>

08:58.030 --> 08:59.560
Thanks.

09:01.790 --> 09:03.430
What's wrong? Komura-kun.

09:03.920 --> 09:04.880
Nothing.

09:04.880 --> 09:08.030
I just wish I were a little bit taller.

09:11.660 --> 09:12.440
No.

09:16.350 --> 09:19.600
You mean you wouldn't want me to be taller?

09:20.800 --> 09:22.260
W-Why?

09:24.280 --> 09:27.790
I won't be able to reach when 
I look at your face like this.

09:32.720 --> 09:36.440
Oh, but I can tell who you are by your 
voice sometimes these days, though.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.760
Like earlier.

09:38.410 --> 09:41.590
But I still kinda like being 
able to see your face.

09:41.590 --> 09:44.720
I guess you're gonna grow, though.

09:47.300 --> 09:50.020
<i>May I never grow taller!</i>

09:50.020 --> 09:54.280
<i>May I never, ever grow taller!</i>

10:05.290 --> 10:08.420
<i>Sh-Sh-She's crying!</i>

10:08.850 --> 10:11.000
<i>Is something wrong?</i>

10:11.000 --> 10:12.760
<i>Should I not pry?</i>

10:12.760 --> 10:13.920
<i>Although...</i>

10:14.270 --> 10:17.620
Komura-kun, hey, hey...

10:17.620 --> 10:22.140
Asuka-chan, Maho-chan and I were looking 
at what's going to be on the exam...

10:23.030 --> 10:28.460
And I realized these four little 
characters all look like "forest."

10:27.600 --> 10:32.610
<b>Logging</b>

10:28.460 --> 10:32.610
So I read "forest, forest, forest, forest," 
and Asuka-chan laughed at me really hard.

10:32.610 --> 10:34.870
<i>And that shock is what made her cry!</i>

10:34.870 --> 10:37.920
Her laughing made me laugh really hard, too.

10:38.960 --> 10:40.370
I was in tears.

10:41.420 --> 10:44.490
<i>I'm glad she wasn't crying 
over something bad.</i>

10:45.260 --> 10:46.300
<i>I see.</i>

10:46.300 --> 10:48.500
<i>She was just laughing so 
hard she was in tears.</i>

10:52.890 --> 10:54.920
<i>Mie-san laughing so hard she's in tears?!</i>

10:54.920 --> 10:56.220
<i>What?!</i>

10:56.220 --> 10:57.800
<i>I-I wish I could have seen that!</i>

10:57.800 --> 11:00.010
<i>I wonder how she was laughing.</i>

11:00.010 --> 11:04.010
<i>I can picture her laughing quietly, 
but if she was in tears...</i>

11:04.410 --> 11:07.270
<i>Was she cackling?</i>

11:08.320 --> 11:10.810
<i>Why wasn't I in the classroom?!</i>

11:11.830 --> 11:14.300
<i>I wonder if Yasaka-kun or anyone else saw it.</i>

11:14.300 --> 11:15.820
<i>I should ask later.</i>

11:24.890 --> 11:25.810
Sleepy.

11:29.160 --> 11:31.580
<i>That's plenty.</i>

11:37.050 --> 11:40.050
<b>Class 2-B</b>

11:42.000 --> 11:43.220
Hey, look.

11:44.830 --> 11:46.500
That cloud's awesome, isn't it?

11:46.500 --> 11:47.680
You're right.

11:47.680 --> 11:48.930
It's heart-shaped.

11:48.930 --> 11:50.230
So pretty.

11:51.280 --> 11:52.380
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

11:52.380 --> 11:53.170
You!

11:53.170 --> 11:54.530
We're in class!

11:59.440 --> 12:02.200
<i>Mie-san's really curious.</i>

12:04.330 --> 12:06.190
Who's got their phone out?

12:06.190 --> 12:07.320
I'll confiscate it!

12:07.320 --> 12:08.560
Wow, who was that?

12:08.560 --> 12:09.920
Sorry!

12:09.920 --> 12:10.810
Look at him go!

12:10.810 --> 12:11.620
Hey!

12:11.620 --> 12:12.620
I'll be angry next time!

12:12.620 --> 12:13.210
C'mon!

12:16.600 --> 12:17.710
<i>She gave up.</i>

12:19.100 --> 12:21.260
<i>She doesn't have her glasses.</i>

12:31.150 --> 12:33.370
And so thusly...

12:34.240 --> 12:35.330
Who was that?!

12:35.330 --> 12:36.530
You're getting it now!

12:36.530 --> 12:38.190
Seriously, give it a rest.

12:40.890 --> 12:41.740
<i>Lime.</i>

12:43.240 --> 12:47.370
"I got a picture of the clouds from 
earlier, so I'll send it to you."

13:00.950 --> 13:03.810
<i>I hope that wasn't uncalled-for.</i>

13:13.640 --> 13:16.690
I was sure I wore my glasses today...

13:17.380 --> 13:19.040
Where did I put them?

13:22.160 --> 13:25.100
I wonder if Mie-san lost 
her glasses somewhere.

13:25.100 --> 13:26.470
Komura!

13:27.790 --> 13:29.300
S-Someya-san.

13:29.300 --> 13:30.900
Nice timing!

13:30.900 --> 13:32.540
Come here for a second.

13:34.310 --> 13:35.440
What for?

13:35.440 --> 13:37.480
<i>I've never really talked to her much.</i>

13:41.850 --> 13:43.690
Aren't these Mie-san's?

13:45.400 --> 13:46.510
I think so.

13:46.800 --> 13:49.900
They were at the bathroom sink.

13:50.550 --> 13:52.780
These lenses are so thick.

13:53.520 --> 13:57.360
<i>She's messing with Mie-san's glasses!</i>

13:57.360 --> 13:59.560
You sit next to her, don't you?

14:00.350 --> 14:01.940
Bring them to her for me.

14:11.720 --> 14:12.400
See?

14:12.400 --> 14:14.100
They're really thick, right?

14:25.630 --> 14:26.960
<i>Who's that?</i>

14:26.960 --> 14:28.750
<i>What are they up to?</i>

14:30.840 --> 14:32.380
What was that for, Komura?

14:32.380 --> 14:33.970
You're pretty bold.

14:35.970 --> 14:39.030
You're always so quiet in class.

14:39.030 --> 14:40.560
Just messing.

14:41.800 --> 14:42.900
Sorry.

14:42.900 --> 14:43.930
Are you all right?

14:43.930 --> 14:45.570
Oh, Mie-san.

14:45.570 --> 14:46.820
These glasses...

14:56.560 --> 14:57.600
What was that, Mie-san?

14:57.600 --> 14:58.740
You're so funny.

14:58.740 --> 15:00.560
S-Sorry about that.

15:00.560 --> 15:01.460
I just...

15:01.460 --> 15:03.210
You're so cute.

15:03.210 --> 15:04.460
No, I...

15:40.410 --> 15:41.300
Morning!

15:45.830 --> 15:47.250
Morning, Komura-kun.

15:48.330 --> 15:49.260
Morning.

15:53.520 --> 15:56.510
<i>Mie-san always forgets her glasses,</i>

15:56.510 --> 16:00.520
<i>but she does have her glasses 
with her more often than not.</i>

16:00.870 --> 16:05.770
<i>In other words, on most days, 
she doesn't need my support.</i>

16:07.030 --> 16:14.510
<i>So it's a little sad, but what's important 
is that Mie-san is doing all right.</i>

16:16.170 --> 16:21.290
<i>Besides, my heart can't take being 
so close to her all the time.</i>

16:23.250 --> 16:24.390
Thanks.

16:42.370 --> 16:44.600
<i>I can just think of it as a break.</i>

16:48.500 --> 16:49.360
Huh?

16:49.360 --> 16:49.980
Huh?!

16:52.970 --> 16:55.460
M-Mie-san...

16:56.460 --> 16:58.990
Hey, I think I forgot my textbook.

16:59.400 --> 17:01.380
If you don't mind...

17:01.380 --> 17:03.000
Wanna use mine?

17:03.680 --> 17:05.000
You seem eager.

17:05.000 --> 17:08.450
You don't forget your things too often.

17:08.450 --> 17:11.000
I'm glad I can return the favor, for once.

17:11.000 --> 17:12.510
I appreciate it.

17:14.220 --> 17:16.220
Wh-What's wrong?

17:16.480 --> 17:20.220
I didn't notice when
I didn't have my glasses,

17:20.220 --> 17:24.730
but you're really close up when 
we have our desks together.

17:25.600 --> 17:26.870
It surprised me.

17:31.810 --> 17:33.440
Komura-kun?

17:33.820 --> 17:34.820
<i>Now?!</i>

17:35.200 --> 17:37.950
<i>You say that now?!</i>

17:49.210 --> 17:52.710
{)\fs9\fax-0.35\frz6\c&HCCCCD3&\move(79,83,152,83,24,3486)}Megane Eye-Eye

17:49.530 --> 17:52.710
Thanks for coming with me, Komura-kun.

17:53.540 --> 17:58.830
I thought I'd buy new glasses to 
replace the ones I lost the other day.

17:58.830 --> 18:00.260
Oh, these are spares.

18:00.990 --> 18:03.810
<i>Why do I have the pleasure of 
being asked to come along again?</i>

18:03.810 --> 18:04.620
So...

18:05.580 --> 18:09.310
Since I'm here, I want to try 
on a lot of different pairs.

18:09.310 --> 18:12.400
But the demo glasses are non-prescription,

18:12.400 --> 18:16.110
so I can't tell whether they 
look good on me or not.

18:16.490 --> 18:22.870
I always have Dad tell me, but 
he's not here today, so...

18:22.870 --> 18:26.870
<i>I-I'm picking out Mie-san's glasses?!</i>

18:30.380 --> 18:33.380
<i>A brutally heavy responsibility!</i>

18:36.910 --> 18:38.000
How are these?

18:40.490 --> 18:42.000
<i>Relax! Relax!</i>

18:42.000 --> 18:43.890
<i>Don't freak out!</i>

18:44.430 --> 18:47.390
<i>I have to choose the right glasses for her!</i>

18:47.390 --> 18:48.450
How about these?

18:48.450 --> 18:50.360
Super cute!

18:50.360 --> 18:51.580
How about these?

18:51.580 --> 18:53.450
Extremely cute!

18:53.450 --> 18:54.470
How about these?

18:54.470 --> 18:58.000
Cute as hell!

18:58.000 --> 19:00.740
I think they're really cute.

19:00.740 --> 19:01.750
<i>Damn it!</i>

19:01.750 --> 19:03.620
<i>Synonyms are all I've got!</i>

19:05.360 --> 19:06.310
These?

19:08.040 --> 19:09.620
Incredibly cute.

19:09.620 --> 19:12.690
<i>Is that all I can say?!</i>

19:12.690 --> 19:14.500
<i>I should have brought my dictionary!</i>

19:15.700 --> 19:17.760
Or maybe even these?

19:19.780 --> 19:20.560
They work.

19:21.010 --> 19:21.930
<i>It's no use.</i>

19:21.930 --> 19:23.420
<i>They all look good on her.</i>

19:23.420 --> 19:27.520
<i>If there's even such thing as a pair of glasses 
that don't look good on her, I'd like to see them.</i>

19:28.810 --> 19:31.900
Well then...

19:33.370 --> 19:35.150
<i>I'm not being useful at all.</i>

19:35.150 --> 19:37.650
<i>I feel like I'm confusing her.</i>

19:38.360 --> 19:40.850
<i>I have to say something clearer!</i>

19:40.850 --> 19:43.150
<i>I need to give her a proper opinion.</i>

19:43.590 --> 19:44.540
<i>Let's see...</i>

19:45.140 --> 19:48.950
<i>What's the Mie-san I like best?</i>

19:56.570 --> 19:57.800
Komura-kun?

20:01.680 --> 20:02.970
Are you okay?

20:06.330 --> 20:08.080
I-I'm fine.

20:08.870 --> 20:09.970
Good.

20:17.090 --> 20:18.890
Hey, I...

20:20.240 --> 20:26.280
No matter what kind of glasses you're 
wearing, or even if you aren't wearing glasses...

20:26.670 --> 20:29.120
It's all good to me.

20:35.200 --> 20:39.800
S-Sorry, I'm not going to be useful.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.250
Okay...

20:52.440 --> 20:53.810
How about these?

20:57.670 --> 20:59.070
The usual.

21:13.710 --> 21:16.830
<b>Class 2-B</b>

21:20.840 --> 21:23.840
I fell asleep with those 
glasses I just bought.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.450
And, well...

21:25.890 --> 21:27.340
It went snap.

21:31.230 --> 21:35.530
<i>I'm gonna need a stable income if 
I'm going to take care of Mie-san.</i>

23:11.380 --> 23:12.660
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.660 --> 23:14.080
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:14.810 --> 23:17.230
One day, close to Valentine's Day...

23:18.180 --> 23:20.750
Right, it's almost Valentine's Day!

23:20.750 --> 23:22.170
I don't want to know what happens next,

23:22.480 --> 23:24.500
but I still have to do the preview!

23:24.500 --> 23:26.050
But I don't want to know!

23:26.050 --> 23:28.990
What is Mie-san doing for Valentine's Day?

23:28.990 --> 23:30.680
Who is she giving chocolates to?

23:30.680 --> 23:40.020
Episode 5

23:30.680 --> 23:40.020
I Met With the

23:30.680 --> 23:40.020
Girl I Like On Valentine's Day

23:30.940 --> 23:31.840
Next episode:

23:31.840 --> 23:34.630
I Met With the Girl I Like
 On Valentine's Day.

23:34.630 --> 23:35.180
I meet her?

23:35.600 --> 23:36.560
Of course I do.

23:36.560 --> 23:38.300
We still have school as usual.
